    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo.7 Raglan Hall is a fully renovated, “B” rated two-bedroom apartment which is situated within striking distance from Ballsbridge village. This period home is packed with character and superb features such as its modern kitchen, large living room and sperate dining room. Situated within easy reach of a wide range of excellent amenities, school, transport links and parks, this stunning property is sure to be of interest to a wide audience. \n\nNo.7 is an immaculate two-bedroom apartment located on the first floor of this prestigious development. Accessed through its own front door, this home offers excellent security and bright, fresh interiors. An entrance hall leads through to the large open-plan living room, separate dining room and bespoke kitchen with integrated “Bosch” appliances. To the front there is a large double bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and en-suite. To the rear there is a second double bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe and a family bathroom with access to a built-in utility press.\n\nRaglan Hall is a luxury development boasting magnificent Georgian features such as 3.5-meter ceilings, large sash windows and decorative ceiling coving.\n\nSituated in this prime residential location, Clyde Road is within walking distance of both Ballsbridge and Lansdowne Villages with their array of fashionable shops, boutiques and restaurants. A wide range of recreational facilities are nearby, such as Herbert Park with its 32 acres of grounds catering for an extensive range of amenities that include bowling greens, football pitches, tennis courts, children's playground and leisurely strolls around the pond. Also close by are the Aviva Stadium, the RDS Showgrounds and David Lloyd Riverview to name just a few landmarks. There is an excellent choice of schools and third level colleges on hand to include St. Conleth's College, St Michael's College, UCD and Trinity College."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nWith glass double doors to the hallway, a feature arch window, alarm panel, ceiling coving and ceiling rose.\n\nLiving Room: - \nLarge dual aspect room with three sash windows, ceiling coving/ ceiling rose, feature open fire, tv/phone points and double doors to the dining room.\n\nDining Room: - \nTwo built in cupboards/drawers with downlighters, a sash window to the rear, tv/phone points, ceiling coving/ceiling rose and a door to the kitchen.\n\nKitchen: - \nWith tiled flooring and tiled back splash, a sash window to the rear, marble counter tops, integrated oven/hob, integrated fridge/freezer, integrated dish washer, integrated microwave, stainless steel sink with drainer, recessed lighting, ceiling coving and under floor heating.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nDouble room with a sash window to the front, ceiling coving, tv/phone points and a door to the walk-in wardrobe.\n\nWalk-In-Wardrobe: - \nWith fully fitted hanging rails, shelving and drawers. A door to the en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nWith tiled flooring and tiled walls, w.c. wash hand basin, chrome wall mounted heated towel rail, large walk-in shower with rainfall attachments, fitted led mirror and under floor heating.\n\nUtility: - \nPlumbed for washer/dryer, built in laundry shelf, built in cupboards and door to the bathroom\n\nFamily Bathroom: - \nWith tiled flooring and tiled walls, w.c. wash hand basin, chrome wall mounted heated towel rail, bath with overhead rainfall attachment, fitted led mirror and under floor heating.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nDouble room with a sash window to the rear, ceiling coving/ceiling rose, tv/phone points, a door to the walk-in wardrobe.\n\nWalk-In-Wardrobe: - \nFully fitted wardrobe with built in rails and shelving.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Turnkey, fully renovated “B” rated two-bedroom apartment</li><li> Stunning Georgian features throughout</li><li> 3.5-meter ceiling height</li><li> Sash windows</li><li> Own front door</li><li> Gated secure parking</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Ideal location in Ballsbridge and within walking distance of St Stephens Green, Merrion Square, Donnybrook and Ranelagh Village.</ul>"
      },
